second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"What sport is Ryan Davis associated with?\", \"slot_hint\": \"sport\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0003-43bf250327c9:d00\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 158, \"text\": \"part in both a North Shore premiership (in which he won best on ground) and NSW series win Ryan was offered a rookie spot with West Coast for the 2008 season.\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0003-43bf250327c9:d00\", \"start\": 159, \"end\": 340, \"text\": \"Davis made his AFL debut for the West Coast Eagles at Gold Coast Stadium versus North Melbourne in Round 8 of the 2008 AFL season and continued to play 11 games in his debut season.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0003-43bf250327c9:d00\", \"start\": 341, \"end\": 450, \"text\": \"After this he moved to Swan Districts and went on to play in a premiership and win a league best and fairest.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0003-43bf250327c9:d00\", \"start\": 451, \"end\": 507, \"text\": \"After six years out of the AFL, he was recruited by Gold\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0003-43bf250327c9:d01\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 13, \"text\": \"2008 season .\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0003-43bf250327c9:d01\", \"start\": 14, \"end\": 103, \"text\": \"[ 8 ] He was delisted at the end of the year and was not selected in the 2008 AFL Draft .\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0003-43bf250327c9:d01\", \"start\": 104, \"end\": 205, \"text\": \"He attempted to convert sports to become a punter in the NFL , [ 9 ] but was not signed by any team .\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0003-43bf250327c9:d01\", \"start\": 206, \"end\": 337, \"text\": \"In 2012 , Davis became a runner for the Sydney Swans and was also employed as a marking and kicking coach for the Cronulla Sharks .\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0003-43bf250327c9:d01\", \"start\": 338, \"end\": 461, \"text\": \"[ 10 ] He then moved to the Sydney Roosters to be their kicking coach.In 2020 , the club also announced they had signed him\"}, \"D3S1\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0003-43bf250327c9:d02\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 163, \"text\": \"195 cm ( 6 ft 5 in ) Weight 90 kg ( 198 lb ) Playing career 1 Years Club Games ( Goals ) 1991–1993 Fitzroy 5 ( 1 ) 1 Playing statistics correct to the end of 1993.\"}, \"D3S2\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0003-43bf250327c9:d02\", \"start\": 164, \"end\": 334, \"text\": \"Sources: AFL Tables, AustralianFootball.com Bradley James Davis (born 18 July 1972) is a former basketball player who played in the National Basketball Association (NBA).\"}, \"D3S3\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0003-43bf250327c9:d02\", \"start\": 335, \"end\": 432, \"text\": \"A center, Davis started his career at the Burnie Hawks, from where he was drafted by an NBA team.\"}, \"D3S4\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0003-43bf250327c9:d02\", \"start\": 433, \"end\": 538, \"text\": \"They selected him due to his impressive height and skills, which made him a valuable asset in the league.\"}, \"D4S1\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0003-43bf250327c9:d03\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 42, \"text\": \"589 yards and also scored two touchdowns .\"}, \"D4S2\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0003-43bf250327c9:d03\", \"start\": 43, \"end\": 87, \"text\": \"He also contributed 9 carries for 43 yards .\"}, \"D4S3\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0003-43bf250327c9:d03\", \"start\": 88, \"end\": 163, \"text\": \"Davis was a nominee for CFL 'Most Outstanding Rookie ' of the 2021 season .\"}, \"D4S4\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0003-43bf250327c9:d03\", \"start\": 164, \"end\": 221, \"text\": \"[ 7 ] On February 14 , 2023 , Davis became a free agent .\"}, \"D4S5\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0003-43bf250327c9:d03\", \"start\": 222, \"end\": 376, \"text\": \"[ 8 ] Vegas Vipers [ edit ] After participating in the XFL Combine , Davis 's league playing rights were acquired by the Vegas Vipers on August 9 , 2023 .\"}, \"D4S6\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0003-43bf250327c9:d03\", \"start\": 377, \"end\": 431, \"text\": \"[ 9 ] He signed with the Vipers on October 18 , 2023 .\"}, \"D4S7\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0003-43bf250327c9:d03\", \"start\": 432, \"end\": 461, \"text\": \"[ 10 ] The Vipers folded when\"}, \"D5S1\": {\"document_number\": 5, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0003-43bf250327c9:d04\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 254, \"text\": \"24 26 2 28 19 5 0 0 0 1 0 2018 Rd 23 22 3 25 7 2 0 0 0 0 0 2018 Rd 21 23 5 28 13 0 0 0 0 0 0 2018 Rd 20 22 2 24 5 2 0 0 0 0 0 2018 Rd 19 21 3 24 4 1 0 0 0 0 0 2018 Rd 18 19 4 23 13 1 0 0 1 0 0 2018 Rd 16 12 3 15 2 5 0 1 0 0 0 2018 Rd 15 21 1 22 5 1 0 0 2\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0003-43bf250327c9:d00\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0003-43bf250327c9:d00:c0\", \"entity\": \"Ryan Davis\", \"scope\": \"sport\", \"claim\": \"Ryan Davis is associated with the Australian Football League (AFL).\", \"answer\": \"Australian Football League (AFL)\", \"quote\": \"part in both a North Shore premiership (in which he won best on ground) and NSW series win Ryan was offered a rookie spot with West Coast for the 2008 season. Davis made his AFL debut for the West Coast Eagles at Gold Coast Stadium versus North Melbourne in Round 8 of the 2008 AFL season and continued to play 11 games in his debut season.\", \"original_document_number\": 1}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0003-43bf250327c9:d01\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0003-43bf250327c9:d0